      {
        "author_name": "asmt eladawy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104966178805354717698/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBddOjIw11OVf8PCqXW8P0iCAAVE-lUDLnOJyIBuVRmVrIFQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nI highly recommend this pharmacy! The team always goes above and beyond to help with anything I need, even when it’s not strictly part of their job. They respond quickly, communicate with my doctor whenever necessary, and make every step easy and stress-free.\n\nA special thank you to Pharmacist Atef, who truly leads the team with dedication and kindness. He always does his best to support his patients, and it really shows.\n\nExceptional service, professional staff, and genuine care — thank you for everything!",
        "time": 1764699119,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sabrina Orsini",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111124625266152696069/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJa9CFet8WANo8q0bGbOqnASy32_Lsj1xuxh6NEGY7S2Tr-aA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing pharmacy , great staff, quick service . They always go way beyond for their clients . The owner always gives great advice and alternatives for any kind of treatment. Last night , went in panicked because my son git bit by a tic. They removed it safely themselves and administered an antibiotic on the spot for prevention purposes… I mean who does that ?!?!?! 🥰❤️",
        "time": 1746742665,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
