        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJobFyQKWb4XWoZsXgjb41PgSQEwmuoshOXXxJUBwtxt_e1Zt4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Wow! Amazing pharmacy. The service is the best and they don’t take time at all to prepare the prescription compared to other pharmacies. Everyone is also so kind and welcoming.",
        "time": 1747187910,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stacey Forward",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115360984128037981919/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpMLc3wcrvWhVM0LStDLd3ca_1kFfcEsQ_6TXJM4rKPNllVU4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Amazing! Went for a second opinion on a tick bite after getting conflicting information from another pharmacist and Info-Santé. The pharmacist and other staff I dealt with were extremely kind and empathetic throughout the entire process. Even though I didn't have a file here, they were able to open one, and provide the antibiotic treatment on the spot. Very grateful for the excellent and rapid service provided by Uniprix clinique A. Helkany, L. Hodhod et A. Abdou, thank you!",
        "time": 1732638549,
